---
// Cases Section — Real achievements with data
---

<section class="section cases" id="cases">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="section-label">实战案例</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">用结果说话</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        每一个案例都是一线实战，不是 PPT 里的概念。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="cases-grid">
      <!-- Case 1: MPE 智能床 -->
      <div class="case-card card reveal">
        <div class="case-header">
          <div class="case-header-left">
            <span class="case-brand" style="--brand-color: #2d8cf0">MPE</span>
            <span class="tag">AI + 投放</span>
          </div>
          <span class="case-period">2025.11 — 至今</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="case-title">MPE 智能床 · 获客成本最高降 80%</h3>
        <p class="case-desc">
          把每天 2 小时的数据整理压到 10 分钟，冷启动 2 个月累计高意向线索 200+ 条。AI 工作流重构了整个投放流程。
        </p>
        <div class="case-metrics">
          <div class="case-metric">
            <span class="case-metric-value">200→50</span>
            <span class="case-metric-label">深圳单条成本（元）</span>
          </div>
          <div class="case-metric">
            <span class="case-metric-value">30-40</span>
            <span class="case-metric-label">全国单条成本（元）</span>
          </div>
          <div class="case-metric">
            <span class="case-metric-value">90%</span>
            <span class="case-metric-label">数据整理时间降幅</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Case 2: 爱汤米家居 -->
      <div class="case-card card reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <div class="case-header">
          <div class="case-header-left">
            <span class="case-brand" style="--brand-color: #e85d26">爱汤米</span>
            <span class="tag">直播获客</span>
          </div>
          <span class="case-period">2022.10 — 2024.03</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="case-title">爱汤米家居 · 团队 3→40+ 人</h3>
        <p class="case-desc">
          公司第一个员工，从零搭建直播获客体系。起号 7 个成功 6 个，单月单账号最高 1000+ 留资，最高单月变现 150 万。
        </p>
        <div class="case-metrics">
          <div class="case-metric">
            <span class="case-metric-value counter" data-target="5000" data-suffix="万">5,000万</span>
            <span class="case-metric-label">2023 年全年销售额</span>
          </div>
          <div class="case-metric">
            <span class="case-metric-value">86%</span>
            <span class="case-metric-label">起号成功率（6/7）</span>
          </div>
          <div class="case-metric">
            <span class="case-metric-value counter" data-target="1000" data-suffix="+">1000+</span>
            <span class="case-metric-label">单月最高留资</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Case 3: YouTube Shorts -->
      <div class="case-card card reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="case-header">
          <div class="case-header-left">
            <span class="case-brand" style="--brand-color: #ff0000">YT</span>
            <span class="tag">AI 内容</span>
          </div>
          <span class="case-period">2026.04</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="case-title">YouTube Shorts · 半个月 500 万+ 播放</h3>
        <p class="case-desc">
          一个人 + AI，15 天做出 500 万播放。用 Seedance 2.0 批量生成游戏 IP 二创视频，验证了 AI 内容的规模化产出能力。
        </p>
        <div class="case-metrics">
          <div class="case-metric">
            <span class="case-metric-value counter" data-target="500" data-suffix="万+">500万+</span>
            <span class="case-metric-label">总播放量</span>
          </div>
          <div class="case-metric">
            <span class="case-metric-value">15天</span>
            <span class="case-metric-label">达成周期</span>
          </div>
          <div class="case-metric">
            <span class="case-metric-value">1人</span>
            <span class="case-metric-label">独立操盘</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Case 4: 欧派家居 -->
      <div class="case-card card reveal reveal-delay-3">
        <div class="case-header">
          <div class="case-header-left">
            <span class="case-brand" style="--brand-color: #003399">欧派</span>
            <span class="tag">投放优化</span>
          </div>
          <span class="case-period">2024.07 — 2025.04</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="case-title">欧派家居 · 获客成本低于行业 30%+</h3>
        <p class="case-desc">
          首月超额完成 200 条线索，创造 30 万业绩。获客成本 130-140 元/条，远低于行业平均水平。账号粉丝从数百增至 10000+，25 倍增长。
        </p>
        <div class="case-metrics">
          <div class="case-metric">
            <span class="case-metric-value">30万</span>
            <span class="case-metric-label">首月业绩</span>
          </div>
          <div class="case-metric">
            <span class="case-metric-value">30%+</span>
            <span class="case-metric-label">低于行业成本</span>
          </div>
          <div class="case-metric">
            <span class="case-metric-value">25×</span>
            <span class="case-metric-label">粉丝增长</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Case 5: 栖案柜小程序 -->
      <div class="case-card card reveal reveal-delay-4">
        <div class="case-header">
          <div class="case-header-left">
            <span class="case-brand" style="--brand-color: #52c41a">栖案柜</span>
            <span class="tag">AI 产品</span>
          </div>
          <span class="case-period">2026</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="case-title">栖案柜 · 0 编程独立上线微信小程序</h3>
        <p class="case-desc">
          全屋定制 AI 效果图 Prompt 生成器，0 编程基础全程 AI 协作完成，已通过微信审核上线。技术栈：OpenCode + Codex + GitHub + Vercel。
        </p>
        <div class="case-metrics">
          <div class="case-metric">
            <span class="case-metric-value">0</span>
            <span class="case-metric-label">编程基础</span>
          </div>
          <div class="case-metric">
            <span class="case-metric-value">已上线</span>
            <span class="case-metric-label">微信审核通过</span>
          </div>
          <div class="case-metric">
            <span class="case-metric-value">全AI</span>
            <span class="case-metric-label">协作完成</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Case 6: OrbitOS -->
      <div class="case-card card reveal reveal-delay-5">
        <div class="case-header">
          <div class="case-header-left">
            <span class="case-brand" style="--brand-color: #c9a55c">OrbitOS</span>
            <span class="tag">系统基建</span>
          </div>
          <span class="case-period">2025.11 — 至今</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="case-title">OrbitOS · 多 AI 协作知识管理系统</h3>
        <p class="case-desc">
          12 类目录架构 + 5 套模板 + 30+ Skill + Hook 自动化 + 多 AI 协作规范。不是用 AI，是让 AI 成为你的操作系统。
        </p>
        <div class="case-metrics">
          <div class="case-metric">
            <span class="case-metric-value counter" data-target="30" data-suffix="+">30+</span>
            <span class="case-metric-label">Skill 数量</span>
          </div>
          <div class="case-metric">
            <span class="case-metric-value">12类</span>
            <span class="case-metric-label">目录架构</span>
          </div>
          <div class="case-metric">
            <span class="case-metric-value">5套</span>
            <span class="case-metric-label">模板</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cases-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .case-card {
    padding: 32px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .case-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .case-header-left {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .case-brand {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-color, var(--accent)) 15%, transparent);
    color: var(--brand-color, var(--accent));
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-color, var(--accent)) 25%, transparent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .case-period {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .case-title {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .case-desc {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .case-metrics {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 24px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .case-metric {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    min-width: 80px;
  }

  .case-metric-value {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .case-metric-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .cases-grid {
      gap: 20px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .cases-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .case-card {
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .case-title {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .case-metrics {
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .case-metric-value {
      font-size: 18px;
    }
  }
</style>
